# Vercel serves every file in the deployment, so a static deploy of this repo
# would publish the whole thing. Only the landing page should be public.
#
# The spreadsheet holds Forum Sport's margins, net prices and stock coverage —
# it must never be downloadable from the deployment URL.
dataset/
data/

# Server-side code and schema: no reason to ship them to the browser.
scripts/
supabase/

# Project notes and docs stay in the (private) repo.
*.md
!index.html

# Local tooling and credential templates.
.claude/
.mcp.json
.env*
.github/

# The design system kit: 17 MB of brand source, screenshots of the live site and
# a React UI kit. Never part of the deployed page.
Forum Sport Design System/
# Same reasoning: 1,7 MB of IE's brand kit — logos, tokens and the written
# manual. The lab page at /lab carries its own copy of the two logos and has
# the token VALUES inlined, so nothing here is needed at runtime.
IE Design System/
